Titanium is where the combination this build rests on comes from: a Vanadium
base carrying Chromium's desktop extension support on Android. Aerium takes
more than the idea. patch.sh, common.sh and args.gn originate in Titanium's
scripts, still carry its structure, and are kept in sync with it by hand, with
helium/aerium path renames applied. UPDATING.md documents that procedure.

theme.sh, build.sh, res/ and the CI workflows are Aerium's own.

